@* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    _PanelTest.cshtml  —  Panel Test for Telemetry Live (Advanced Telemetry)
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

    HOW IT INTEGRATES WITH TELEMETRY LIVE
    ──────────────────────────────────────
    • Opened via:  window._ptOpenFromTelemetryLive()  (called by the Panel Test
      button in Index.cshtml's filter bar).

    • SiteId is read directly from  #drpSite  (Telemetry Live filter bar).
    • Asset types are loaded from   /Telemetry/GetAssetTypeBySiteId  using that siteId.
    • Assets per type from          /Telemetry/GetAssestBy
    • History data from             /Telemetry/GetHistoryData  (same as original)

    • Live data watermark: when wsLiveData is populated the header shows a
      ● LIVE badge and the stat strip shows the ws-connected asset count.

    RENDER via: @Html.Partial("_PanelTest")
    Trigger via: _ptOpenFromTelemetryLive()
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ *@

<style>
    @@keyframes pt-spin {
        to {
            transform: rotate(360deg);
        }
    }

    @@keyframes ptSlideIn {
        from {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(14px);
        }

        to {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: none;
        }
    }

    @@keyframes ptBarGrow {
        from {
            width: 0;
        }
    }

    @@keyframes ptLivePulse {
        0%, 100% {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        50% {
            opacity: .3;
        }
    }

    @@keyframes ptFadeIn {
        from {
            opacity: 0;
        }

        to {
            opacity: 1;
        }
    }

    /* ── Overlay ── */
    #ptOverlay {
        display: none;
        position: fixed;
